# PhoenixRepair

Run PhoenixRepair with `./run_our_method.sh --model MODEL --instances MANIFEST`.
The CLI in `phoenix/cli.py` loads the model configuration. The pipeline in
`phoenix/pipeline.py` coordinates localization, candidate generation and the
final patch. The worker uses the agent implementation in `sweagent/agent/`
and runs the tool bundles in `tools/` inside Docker via SWE-ReX.
